OL,3,GNEWSAPC who used Taser to deliver
OL,4,A'hammer blows' keeps job
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Suffolk Police officer who struck a
OL,7,Fman reportedly armed with a metal pole
OL,8,Fwith the butt of his Taser - described
OL,9,Fas "improvised hammer blows" - has been
OL,10,Fallowed to keep his job.
OL,12,FPC Samuel Robinson had been called to
OL,13,Freports of a domestic dispute in
OL,14,FLowestoft in June 2021 before the man
OL,15,Fpunched an officer and resisted arrest.
OL,17,FAfter a struggle, the man ended up on
OL,18,Fthe ground before Robinson struck the
OL,19,Fsuspect on the head with the butt of
OL,20,Fhis Taser three times and kicked him,
OL,21,Fit was reported.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
