OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPC who used Taser to deliver
OL,4,A'hammer blows' keeps job
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing an investigation by the
OL,7,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct
OL,8,F(IOPC), a police disciplinary panel
OL,9,Fruled he had committed gross misconduct
OL,10,Fand gave him a five-year final written
OL,11,Fwarning.
